      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rotonda_West%2C_Florida"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Golf shaped the community, with the layout divided into wedge‑shaped sectors named after famous golf clubs like Pebble Beach and Pinehurst.",
